'''Beyond the Savannah''' (超越サバンナ ''Chōetsu Sabanna'', '''Transcendent Savannah''') is the 44th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Like the [[Area 22|previous sub-chapter]], most of Beyond the Savannah's stages contain [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]]. For this reason, its difficulty will vary depending on one's [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]]. Out of all the stages, [[Heaven's Oasis]] is by far the hardest, and possibly one of the hardest in all of Stories of Legend, featuring a nasty combo of [[Winged Pigge]] and [[R.Ost]]. If attempting to clear higher Crown difficulties of Stories of Legend, save this chapter for last.
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Winged Pigge]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy with high health, decent attack power, [[Omni Strike]] attacks that extend past her range, and the ability to [[Weaken]] Cat Units to 10%.

